  "body_md": "Live music is listed every night in Venice, Nokomis, and Englewood. Hours are included only when a listing gives them.\n\n## By night\n\n- **Sunday:** Captain Eddie's Seafood, Farlow's On The Water, Lighthouse Grill and Tiki Bar, Nokomo's Sunset Hut, Paradise Grill, Pop's Sunset Grill, SandBar Tiki & Grille.\n- **Monday:** Cafe Venice Restaurant & Bar, Captain Eddie's Seafood, Lighthouse Grill and Tiki Bar, Nokomo's Sunset Hut, Paradise Grill, Pop's Sunset Grill, SandBar Tiki & Grille.\n- **Tuesday:** Captain Eddie's Seafood, Lighthouse Grill and Tiki Bar, Nokomo's Sunset Hut, Paradise Grill, Pop's Sunset Grill, SandBar Tiki & Grille.\n- **Wednesday:** Captain Eddie's Seafood, Farlow's On The Water, Lighthouse Grill and Tiki Bar, Nokomo's Sunset Hut, Paradise Grill, Pop's Sunset Grill, SandBar Tiki & Grille.\n- **Thursday:** Cafe Venice Restaurant & Bar, Captain Eddie's Seafood, Farlow's On The Water, Lighthouse Grill and Tiki Bar, Nokomo's Sunset Hut, Paradise Grill, Pop's Sunset Grill, SandBar Tiki & Grille.\n- **Friday:** 3 Bridges Brewing, Cafe Venice Restaurant & Bar, Captain Eddie's Seafood, Farlow's On The Water, Lighthouse Grill and Tiki Bar, Nokomo's Sunset Hut, Paradise Grill, Pop's Sunset Grill, SandBar Tiki & Grille.\n- **Saturday:** 3 Bridges Brewing, Cafe Venice Restaurant & Bar, Captain Eddie's Seafood, Farlow's On The Water, Lighthouse Grill and Tiki Bar, Nokomo's Sunset Hut, Paradise Grill, Pop's Sunset Grill, SandBar Tiki & Grille.\n\n## Good to know\n\n- **Cover:** Unknown.\n- **Setting:** Listed settings are outdoor, waterfront, or mixed.\n- **Food and ages:** Restaurants list a full menu; 3 Bridges Brewing lists bar food. Cafe Venice Restaurant & Bar lists all ages.\n\n## FAQ\n\n### What hours are posted?\nCaptain Eddie's Seafood lists 5:30pm-8:30pm seven nights a week, and Cafe Venice Restaurant & Bar lists 7-10pm Monday, Thursday, Friday, and Saturday.\n\n### Which genres are listed?\nPop's Sunset Grill lists covers and acoustic;